{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50364","headline":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十七、望京门咏 · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌廿咏（并序） 十七、望京门咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"郭门望京处，楼上启重闉。\n水北通西域，桥东路入秦。\n黄沙吐双径[三四]，白草生[三五]三春。\n不见中华使，翩翩起虏尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}